        "sourceAnchor": "Veteran-Recruits",
        "text": "Veteran Recruits\nYour army cannot include the following ADEPTUS ASTARTES units:\n- SCOUT SQUAD units.\n- TERMINATOR SQUAD units.\n- TERMINATOR ASSAULT SQUAD units.",
