    {
      "id": "detachment-rule-dw-b41deacc51464866",
      "kind": "DETACHMENT_RULE",
      "sourceEntityId": "sm-source-af2e8f78186c42e6",
      "bookId": "deathwatch",
      "data": {
        "title": "Mission Tactics",
        "sourceAnchor": "Mission-Tactics-1",
        "text": "Mission Tactics\nFriendly KILL TEAM units with this ability have the following abilities:\nFuror Tactics\nIf the devastator doctrine is active for your unit, your unit’s attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].\nMalleus Tactics\nIf the tactical doctrine is active for your unit, your unit’s attacks have [LETHAL HITS].\nPurgatus Tactics\nIf the assault doctrine is active for your unit, your unit’s attacks that target an enemy unit within 9\" of this unit have [PRECISION].\nDEATHWATCH ALLIES\nYou can include DEATHWATCH units in your army, even though they do not have the same Chapter faction keyword as other units in your army. The combined points value of such units cannot exceed 500 points.\nWhen mustering your army, unless otherwise stated, you cannot select a DEATHWATCH model to be your WARLORD. In addition KILL TEAM units can only contain enhancements taken from this detachment.\nThis an exception to the Space Marine Chapters Army Rules.",
        "execution": "UNVERIFIED",
        "nestedRuleIds": []
      },
      "parentId": "detachment-dw-c015c08e99c14972",
      "sourceRefs": [{"documentId":"documents-3b10e7bb0d4f7d3f","referenceId":"refs-28095866f72dc07a","documentRole":"DOCUMENT","locators":[{"kind":"HTML_POINTER","value":"/html/body/div/div[1]/div[3]/div[41]/div[2]/div[2]"}]}],
