      "data": {
        "title": "KRAKEN ROUNDS",
        "text": "KRAKEN ROUNDS\n1CP\nDeathwatch Support Stratagem\nWHEN: Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.\nTARGET: That KILL TEAM unit.\nEFFECT: Your unit’s ranged attacks have:\n- Have +6\" R.\n- Have +1 S.",
        "execution": "UNVERIFIED"
      },
